#: admin/views/page-help.php:443
msgid "The kwtSMS API allows a maximum of 10 requests per second from a single IP address. Exceeding this limit causes your server's IP to be temporarily blocked by kwtSMS. Under normal use this limit is never reached, each OTP send is one request. If you are running bulk sends or automated tests, introduce a delay between requests."
